COMMENT ON VIEW public.au_v_line_area_map_all IS 'au.line_area_map with history: identical to au_v_line_area_map but WITHOUT the effective_to is null filter. Read only by the Monthly Closing, which resolves the org chart at the month being closed. Every other caller stays on au_v_line_area_map. The effective_to bound is EXCLUSIVE: a row closed on 2026-09-01 covers 2026-08-31 and not 2026-09-01.';

