COMMENT ON TABLE public.crm_contacts IS 'Phoenix contact master: one row per CRM contact, keyed on the CRM contact id. Rebuilt from the read-only ireports360 mirrors by crm_contact_master_refresh(); never edit by hand. Speciality kind is classified in src/lib/crm/contact-taxonomy.ts, not here.';

