--

COMMENT ON CONSTRAINT outstation_expense_requests_expense_type_check ON public.outstation_expense_requests IS 'Mirrors OutstationExpenseType (src/lib/outstation/types.ts). Backstops the app-level check in src/lib/outstation/manager-expense-input.ts — a write path that skips it (as the manager-expenses PATCH route once did) now fails loud instead of silently mis-bucketing the row in every downstream breakdown, filter and export.';

