COMMENT ON TABLE public.sales_records IS 'RETIRED 2026-08-14 (Rule #1 migration, Phase 7). H1 2026 history and the record of what H1 incentives were actually paid on. Every live sales surface reads SoS Monthly Closing (au.f_monthly_achievement) instead — do not repoint anything back here, and do not resume importing. DIRECT writes are revoked from anon/authenticated/service_role and the app refuses at src/lib/sales/service.ts (assertLegacySalesImportOpen, HTTP 410). This is NOT immutability: deleting a row from sales_import_batches still cascades rows away here, and phx_reassign_replacement_ownership (SECURITY DEFINER, owner postgres) still updates it by design.';

