--

COMMENT ON COLUMN public.source_of_sales_regions.ims_ratio IS 'Region-level IMS ratio, stored as a FRACTION (0.0497 = 4.97%). Populated ONLY for regions whose share is tracked as one indivisible block rather than per area — today that is OT ("Others") alone. All other regions are NULL and their share is the sum of their areas'' source_of_sales_areas.ims_ratio. Invariant: sum(non-OT area ratios) + OT region ratio = 1.';

